      'When creating the GKE cluster, select the Allow full access to all Cloud APIs option under \'Access scopes\'.',
      'Create a new service account and grant it access to Artifact Registry. Generate a JSON key for the service account and use it as an imagePullSecrets in Kubernetes.',
      'Set the Artifact Registry permissions on each container image manually to provide read-only access to the default Compute Engine service account.'
