    topic: 'Service accounts',
    difficulty: 'medium',
    verbatim: true,
    prompt: 'You need to grant a third-party vendor temporary access to a Google Cloud resource using a service account. The vendor should not have access beyond the necessary time frame. What is the best approach to achieve this?',
